@startuml
title State Machine Diagram - BPO Management System

[*] --> SelectFilter

state "Select Filter" as SelectFilter
SelectFilter : entry / Get available filters
SelectFilter : do / Display filter categories and price range
SelectFilter : exit / User selects a filter category or price range

' select filter category
SelectFilter --> SearchByCategory : [User selects a filter category]

' select price range
SelectFilter --> SearchByPriceRange : [User selects a price range]

state "Search by Category" as SearchByCategory
SearchByCategory : entry / Get selected filter category
SearchByCategory : do / Display matching users based on the chosen criteria
SearchByCategory : exit / User views search results

' display matching users
SearchByCategory --> ViewResults : [Display matching users]

state "Search by Price Range" as SearchByPriceRange
SearchByPriceRange : entry / Get selected price range
SearchByPriceRange : do / Display matching users based on the chosen criteria
SearchByPriceRange : exit / User views search results

' display matching users
SearchByPriceRange --> ViewResults : [Display matching users]

state "View Results" as ViewResults
ViewResults : entry / Get selected filter category or price range
ViewResults : do / Display user search results
ViewResults : exit / User views search results

[*] --> [*]
@enduml
